        }
      }
    },
    "Close this app before continuing. Veilpath verifies a backup before changing the selected cache folders. You can restore that backup from Backup Center." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先关闭目标应用。Veilpath 会在修改所选缓存目录前验证备份，之后可从备份中心恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App backups and cache recovery backups are kept here without automatic expiry. They are verified again before restoration and can be exported individually." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用备份和缓存恢复备份保存在此，不会自动过期。恢复前会再次验证，也可以单独导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
